# ZeroTrust ControlTrace

**Identity Investigation, Control Reconciliation & Compliance Intelligence**

ZeroTrust ControlTrace is a personal cybersecurity investigation and compliance project exploring how IAM evidence from multiple systems can be consolidated into a structured investigation.

The project uses fully synthetic data and focuses on evidence reconciliation, investigation timelines, findings, compliance control mapping, corrective actions, and human-reviewed AI-assisted synthesis.

